EXPLAIN (COSTS off) SELECT count(*) FROM pt WHERE v = 7 AND d >= '2026-02-01';
                             QUERY PLAN                              
---------------------------------------------------------------------
 Finalize Aggregate
   ->  Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)
         ->  Partial Aggregate
               ->  Append
                     ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on pt_1_prt_2
                           Recheck Cond: (v = 7)
                           Filter: (d >= '2026-02-01'::date)
                           ->  Bitmap Index Scan on pt_1_prt_2_v_idx
                                 Index Cond: (v = 7)
                     ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on pt_1_prt_3
                           Recheck Cond: (v = 7)
                           Filter: (d >= '2026-02-01'::date)
                           ->  Bitmap Index Scan on pt_1_prt_3_v_idx
                                 Index Cond: (v = 7)
 Optimizer: Postgres-based planner
